DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260617T153000
UID:e47775cfac325228d832113ff7a9f523@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:*We have rolling attendance\, so please feel free to join us a
 t any point during the meet up.* Whether you're looking to advance your co
 rporate career\, scale your own business\, or navigate career change - com
 e join this community of ambitious women! Together\, we’ll share practic
 al strategies\, give back to the community\, and build supportive connecti
 ons to elevate your career. If you're ready to break through barriers and 
 make an impact\, this group is your launchpad to success! We are excited t
 o welcome both Jess Moyer and Julie Freeman as our speakers! They will tal
 k about holistic wellness from the inside out: hormones\, nutrition and mo
 vement. We're here to talk about all of it and hope you can join us!
LOCATION:Apex\, NC
URL:https://business.apexchamber.com/events/details/she-means-biz
X-SOURCE:Apex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Brain + Body Reset
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260602T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260602T170000
UID:68687ecc2e2a0d9be08aff78ec5d94af@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Two hours is all it takes to change how your body responds to 
 stress. Join us for a 2-hour immersion that focuses on stress recovery\, b
 rain health\, and nervous system regulation. Four parts. Two experts. One 
 transformation Exploration: Learn how your brain responds under pressure\,
  where it gets stuck\, and how to shift it in real time Immersion: Experie
 nce a guided nervous system reset and breathwork journey Reflection: Refle
 ct on the experience and what may have shifted Integration: Walk away with
  practical tools to recover faster\, every day. THIS IS FOR YOU IF YOU'RE:
  Holding everything together but running on empty. You feel always “on
 ”\, can’t shut off or slow down Craving more presence\, focus\, and co
 nnection Wanting to deepen your practice with nervous system regulation Le
 ave feeling: Calm in the chaos Energized and less depleted Less reactive a
 nd more in control Hosted by: Jen Shepard - Brain Health and Performance S
 trategist - THE SCIENCE & STRATEGY Joss Michael - Master SOMA Brea
LOCATION:Apex\, NC
URL:https://business.apexchamber.com/events/details/brain-body-reset
X-SOURCE:Apex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
